{"baseRefName":"main","body":"## Summary\n- accept ChatGPT's restored full tool-result envelope as well as direct structured output\n- persist a versioned, per-widget Lobu view snapshot for reload fallback\n- make compatibility restoration read-only so widget-state events cannot recursively re-persist\n- persist late live `toolOutput` compatibility events while leaving widget-state-only echoes read-only\n- prefer live result globals across same-origin frames and skip unrelated inner widget state before cached Lobu snapshots\n- preserve unrelated widget state while excluding hidden capability metadata and capability-gated approval controls\n- keep live approval actions available while restricting restored snapshots to safe review links\n- advance the bundle contract to the cache-safe v6 resource URI for the coordinated parent release\n\n## Red to green\n- live red: a fresh ChatGPT SQL card rendered 25 rows and paginated to rows 11-20, but a full reload restored only the generic Lobu result shell\n- review red: the first snapshot implementation could recursively handle its own widget-state event and could restore dead approval controls without a capability\n- review red: the sanitized widget-state echo could replace an authorized live approval card, and explicit metadata loss could leave dead approval controls in a restored direct result\n- review red: cached inner-frame state could win over a live outer-frame result, and a restored full-result envelope with no capability could retain nonfunctional approval buttons\n- release red: shipping changed HTML under cached v5 would make the fix unreliable for existing ChatGPT clients\n- exact-head review red: late `openai:set_globals` tool output was rendered but not persisted, and unrelated inner widget state could mask a valid outer Lobu snapshot\n- green: compatibility echoes are read-only; live result globals win and persist; only a valid versioned Lobu snapshot is selected; full-result capability presence is explicit; standard/preloaded tool results persist once; cached approval views retain only display-safe actions; the bundle verifier requires v6\n\n## Verification\n- focused compatibility/view tests: 4 files, 32 tests passed\n- full Owletto suite: 156 files, 1,331 tests passed\n- targeted Biome check and TypeScript project build passed\n- full production build and v6 MCP bundle verifier passed\n- repository-wide lint remains baseline-red on unrelated existing files; changed files are clean\n- every independent Codex review finding has a regression test or release tripwire; exact-head review is being rerun on commit 1b214fa4\n\n## Parent release contract\nThe parent pointer PR will atomically advertise `ui://lobu/interaction/v6.html`, keep v5 as an external-template compatibility alias, run the full Lobu gates, and gate production verification on the parent squash SHA.\n","headRefName":"codex/mcp-app-widget-state-rehydrate","isDraft":false,"number":788,"reviewDecision":"","title":"fix(mcp): restore ChatGPT cards from widget state","url":"https://github.com/lobu-ai/owletto/pull/788"}

